          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Sarah Kuner"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I attended Alan's beginner's photography course to learn about how to fully understand the manual settings on my camera to up my camera game. Alan clearly explained the technical aspects, gave helpful booklet on each week's session,  and it included 2 weeks access to his excellent online course modules. I enjoyed the course and have just signed up for the composition session.",
