        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Jack"
          },
          "reviewBody": "We've just finished up a 3 week beginners photography course with Alan and really enjoyed it! Alan was a great teacher and would have a laugh with you but also covered a lot each week.  Alan taught us all of the basics of our camera and gave us a great starting point to go away and practice. Along with the 3 sessions we also get access to an online portal with loads of further lessons and guides so we can keep practicing in our own time.",
